# ─── Commit Message Template — آرا املاک ──────────────────────────────────────
# <type>(<scope>): <subject — imperative, lowercase, no period, max 72 chars>
#
# [optional body — free-form, Farsi or English]
#
# [footers]
# Phase: <phase-number>
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>   ← only when breaking API/schema
# Closes #<issue>
#
# ── Types ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   feat       new feature
#   fix        bug fix
#   docs       documentation only
#   style      formatting (no logic change)
#   refactor   code change (not fix/feat)
#   perf       performance improvement
#   test       add/modify tests
#   build      build system / dependencies
#   ci         CI config changes
#   chore      maintenance (no src/test change)
#   revert     revert a previous commit
#
# ── Scopes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   core | accounts | agencies | listings | crm | matching | messaging
#   ai | publishing | rendering | accounting | dashboard
#   ui | infra | deps | specs
#
# ── Examples ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   feat(listings): add property search with PostGIS radius filter
#   fix(accounts): correct OTP expiry check in Redis
#   docs(specs): add phase-2 spec for listings CRUD
#   chore(infra): upgrade PostgreSQL image to 16.3
